{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"additional_concerns\":[\"Candidate node.ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491 adds NAV > 0 as a legal-scope condition without source support, potentially blocking an applicable designation when NAV is unknown or nonpositive.\",\"Its doubled-exposure arithmetic preserves the 50% threshold only for positive, commensurate inputs; the source does not supply valuation, look-through, aggregation, or persistence rules.\",\"The three supplied dependency IDs have null source_hash values and no identifiable authority mappings; none can be treated as available.\",\"The circular does not supply a Fund-specific assessment date, exposure evidence, designation decision, or effective-period rules.\",\"A classification result does not establish compliance with separate investment limits, sale requirements, disclosure duties, or other applicable rules.\"],\"checks\":[{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The referenced prevailing sale authorities in footnote 8 are not supplied and no dependency ID is identifiable for them.\",\"status\":\"MISSING\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.00add447f3aeed5d91c6f5c4\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"Sale requirements are consequences of classification and are outside the typed classification question.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"Result type: bool\"],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"Can Code of Conduct paragraph 5.5, Chapter 6 of the Guidelines on Online Distribution and Advisory Platforms, and the relevant FAQs be supplied?\",\"question_relation????\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805\"}],\"question_hash\":\"667e02878245fac215d7cc7676acbdd52b486e17dea8e9eed9ea5b37ad03a712\",\"rationale\":\"This claim addresses post-classification duties, not whether either classification route applies.\",\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE_TO_THIS_QUESTION\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805\"},{\"quote\":\"Paragraph 5.5 of the SFC’s Code of Conduct for Persons Licensed by or Registered with the Securities and Futures Commission and Chapter 6 of the SFC’s Guidelines on Online Distribution and Advisory Platforms, and the relevant Frequently Asked Questions.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u65.9044\"}],\"rationale\":\"The circular expressly states the consequence, while the complete external requirements remain unavailable.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}},{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The CLO description is supplied directly by the circular and needs no additional authority.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.01925f8d5a24687b8c662d14\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The formula accepts aggregate indirect exposure and does not implement CLO identification or classification; this is an omitted upstream assessment.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"indirect_exposure: Aggregate indirect exposure to private credit and private equity through all relevant holdings and instruments, including qualifying exposures beyond the listed examples, measured under the supplied methodology at the assessment time.\"],\"status\":\"OMITS\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"How are CLO holdings identified and their qualifying private-market exposur